+
+// normalizeShortName returns the request-side canonical form of a short name:
+// whitespace and trailing punctuation stripped and the rest case-folded. It is
+// the single owner of the tolerance rules layered on top of linkID identity,
+// so a change to how messy names are reconciled happens in one place.
+func normalizeShortName(short string) string {
